    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "cited_ids": [
          "INV-AUDIO-01-2"
        ]
      },
      "doc": "docs/audio/01-codec-bringup.md",
      "family": "audio",
      "kind": "gate",
      "line": 287,
      "obj_id": "docs/audio/01-codec-bringup.md:gate:287",
      "text": "(a) Poll R0x732 bit 5 (FLL1_LOCK_STS, level status) with the per-attempt timeout from §9 INV-AUDIO-01-2 after writing `FLL1_ENA = 1`."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "cited_ids": [
          "INV-AUDIO-01-2"
        ]
      },
      "doc": "docs/audio/01-codec-bringup.md",
      "family": "audio",
      "kind": "gate",
      "line": 288,
      "obj_id": "docs/audio/01-codec-bringup.md:gate:288",
      "text": "(b) Re-arm FLL1 on per-attempt timeout up to the retry budget from §9 INV-AUDIO-01-2."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "cited_ids": []
      },
      "doc": "docs/audio/01-codec-bringup.md",
      "family": "audio",
      "kind": "gate",
      "line": 289,
      "obj_id": "docs/audio/01-codec-bringup.md:gate:289",
      "text": "(c) Issue NO writes to R0x4 (AIF1ADC1L/R_ENA), R0x300, R0x302, R0x304, R0x305, R0x210 (or any other post-FLL AIF1 register) until either `FllLockOutcome::LockedFirstTry` or `LockedAfterRetry` is reached."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "cited_ids": [
          "INV-AUDIO-01-3"
        ]
      },
      "doc": "docs/audio/01-codec-bringup.md",
      "family": "audio",
      "kind": "gate",
      "line": 290,
      "obj_id": "docs/audio/01-codec-bringup.md:gate:290",
      "text": "(d) Return `Result<FllLockOutcome, I2C::Error>` per §9 INV-AUDIO-01-3."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "cited_ids": []
      },
      "doc": "docs/audio/01-codec-bringup.md",
      "family": "audio",
      "kind": "gate",
      "line": 291,
      "obj_id": "docs/audio/01-codec-bringup.md:gate:291",
      "text": "(e) On `FllLockOutcome::Failed`, NOT proceed with the remainder of `init_record` — return early."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "cited_ids": []
      },
      "doc": "docs/audio/01-codec-bringup.md",
      "family": "audio",
      "kind": "gate",
      "line": 295,
      "obj_id": "docs/audio/01-codec-bringup.md:gate:295",
      "text": "(f) Log `LockedAfterRetry { attempts }` via the platform's `defmt`/`log`/USART telemetry path to support cold-boot-rate observability."
    },
